    <p><strong>In Production ML:</strong> The models you train are classes. Every scikit-learn classifier, every PyTorch model, every Keras layer is a class. Understanding OOP is not optional — it is how modern ML works. You cannot use TensorFlow effectively without understanding inheritance and polymorphism.</p>
